      "Signals of a potentially valuable audience\nLook for evidence such as:\n- Followers repeatedly ask the creator how to do something.\n- The creator receives detailed questions about a specific challenge.\n- People save, share, or discuss educational posts.\n- The creator’s audience asks for templates, plans, resources, feedback, or step-by-step help.\n- The creator has a community where members discuss the same problems.\n- Followers already spend money on related products or services.\n- The creator has previously sold something successfully, even on a small scale.\nThese are clues, not proof. Validate them through conversations, polls, waitlists, pre-orders where appropriate, and a small pilot.",
