      "Chapter 4 — Turn the creator’s knowledge into a paid product\nThe source identifies knowledge-based products as the main monetization route. Examples include:\n- Courses.\n- Coaching.\n- E-books and guides.\n- Digital products.\n- Small tools.\n- Subscription access to a specialised AI version of the creator.\nThe creator’s existing knowledge is the raw material. Your job is to identify a specific outcome that the audience wants and package the creator’s real expertise into a useful, deliverable offer.",
