      "Chapter 18 — The one-page partnership scorecard\nUse this before committing significant time.\n| Category | Question | Score (0–2) |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Audience | Is the audience clearly defined? |  |\n| Engagement | Do followers ask substantive questions? |  |\n| Problem | Is there a repeated, meaningful problem? |  |\n| Expertise | Can the creator credibly solve it? |  |\n| Product fit | Can the knowledge be packaged responsibly? |  |\n| Commitment | Will the creator participate and promote? |  |\n| Economics | Is there a plausible path to positive unit economics? |  |\n| Operations | Can payments, delivery, and support be handled? |  |\n| Trust | Are claims and practices honest? |  |\n| Agreement | Are responsibilities and rights documented? |  |\n| Total | Maximum 20 |  |",
