      "Both partners should be able to verify the figures from the agreed source of truth.",
      "Final Execution Plan\nThe shadow operator model is a partnership business built around a simple division of strengths:\n- The creator has a focused audience, subject knowledge, and trust.\n- The operator helps turn that knowledge into a product, launch, and operating system.\n- AI accelerates research, drafting, organisation, and marketing preparation.\n- Both parties share the economics under a clear agreement.\nThe most practical route is not to chase a $13,000 monthly target immediately. It is to find one credible micro-creator, identify one repeated audience problem, validate one useful offer, build it with the creator, and run a transparent pilot.",
